  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Users can create, read, update, delete Exports of billing and cost management data.  Users can get details of Export Executions and details of Tables for exporting.  Tagging support is provided for Exports",
